<Layout title="About Virgil Digital | UK web design" description="Meet Virgil, a Bristol-based web designer building fast, practical websites for small businesses across the UK.">
  <span class="kicker">About</span>
  <h1>I build practical websites for people running <span class="accent">real businesses.</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">I'm Virgil, a Bristol-based web designer and developer helping small businesses anywhere in the UK look credible, get found, and make it easier for customers to contact them.</p>

  <h2>Why I started Virgil Digital</h2>
  <p>Good local businesses often rely on word of mouth while their website is missing, outdated, or difficult to use. I started Virgil Digital to give owners a clear, fast website without agency layers or confusing jargon. You deal directly with the person building it.</p>

  <h2>Work I can show</h2>
  <p><a href="https://alterationsbynicole.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Alterations by Nicole</a> is a live site I built for a Bristol tailoring studio, including its enquiry journey and Google presence.</p>
  <p><a href="https://marveldesserts.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Marvel Desserts</a> had been trading for years without a proper website. I built one for the business and am helping recover its Google Business Profile access after control was left with a previous manager.</p>
  <p>I'm also currently working with <strong>Rufus.taxi</strong>, while building and improving the digital work around these projects.</p>

  <h2>What I'm building and learning</h2>
  <p>Alongside client work, I'm building <a href="https://mealwright.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mealwright</a>, an Android meal-planning and diet app with a meal generator. I'm also studying cybersecurity, which keeps me thinking carefully about privacy, accounts, forms, and the systems behind a website. That is ongoing study, not a claim that Virgil Digital provides security consultancy.</p>

  <h2>A little about me</h2>
  <p>Before web work I spent years behind a bar and behind the wheel, including more than 3,000 five-star Uber trips. Those jobs taught me to listen, communicate clearly, stay calm when plans change, and earn trust quickly. That is how I approach client work too.</p>
  <p>I am DMI-certified in digital marketing. <a href="https://certs.digitalmarketinginstitute.com/42dc218d-32ab-4a03-8750-df3b58ca11a5#acc.vz1bCgL0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify the certificate →</a></p>
  <p>If you have a good business but your online presence does not reflect it yet, tell me what you are trying to improve.</p>
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn">Start a conversation</a>
